      "id": "1C810133157B5A8C",
      "title": "&f&lSort by what you do next&r",
      "description": [
        "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
        "&fUnderstand this part of your adventure.",
        "",
        "&fUse named storage for crops, stone, processed metals, mechanisms, tools and expedition loot. Sophisticated Storage and Backpacks add useful upgrades, while ME arrives with Chapter IV.",
        "",
        "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
        "&fKeep an incoming-materials chest so explorers can unload before sorting.",
        "",
        "&7Reading check · Mark this when you understand the guide.",
        "",
        "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
