      "description": [
        "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
        "&fObtain a Backpack Pickup Upgrade and inspect its settings.",
        "",
        "&fUse the Pickup Upgrade for dropped-item collection under its actual range and filter rules. Check the correct storage or backpack variant instead of assuming every upgrade fits both.",
